<title>USA: CIT Group Holdings Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>CIT Group Holdings Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net Income	     $62,800		  $57,500</p>
<p> Operating Revs	 271,100		  234,500</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Net Income	    $260,100		 $225,300</p>
<p> Operating Revs     1,042,000		  882,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: CIT Group Holdings is owned 80 percent by Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd and 20 percent by Chase Manhattan Corp.  </p>
<p>Total assets as of Dec 31: $18.9 billion vs $17.4 billion.</p>
<p>Total finance receivables as of Dec 31: $17.0 billion vs 15.8 billion.</p>
<p>Total debt as of Dec 31: $14.6 billion vs $13.6 billion.</p>
</text>
